etapa&lt;br&gt;✔ Ciclo fechado (T2 retorna a E0)&lt;br&gt;✔ Tempos identificados: 8 s, 10 s, 3 s&lt;br&gt;✔ Etapa inicial inequívoca: E0 (vermelho)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Inicialização em VERMELHO: indicação&lt;br&gt;conhecida e segura ao energizar.&lt;br&gt;Tempo de ciclo = 8 + 10 + 3 = 21 s" style="text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=11;fontColor=#111111;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacingLeft=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="798" y="138" width="340" height="130" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n81" value="" style="shape=note;size=14;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;strokeWidth=1.5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=13;fontColor=#111111;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="790" y="330" width="360" height="130" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n82" value="Testes de fronteira temporal" style="text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;fontColor=#111111;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontStyle=1;spacingLeft=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="798" y="334" width="340" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n83" value="S01: E0 há 7,9 s → permanece E0 (vermelho)&lt;br&gt;S02: E0 há 8,0 s → T0 dispara, E1 (verde)&lt;br&gt;S03: E1 há 9,9 s → permanece E1 (verde)&lt;br&gt;S04: E1 há 10,0 s → T1 dispara, E2 (amarelo)&lt;br&gt;S05: E2 há 2,9 s → permanece E2 (amarelo)&lt;br&gt;S06: E2 há 3,0 s → T2 dispara, E0 (vermelho)" style="text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=11;fontColor=#111111;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacingLeft=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="798" y="358" width="340" height="98" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e54" value="" style="edgeStyle=none;html=1;rounded=0;strokeColor=#222222;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=11;fontColor=#111111;endArrow=none;endFill=1;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exi