parent="1"><mxGeometry x="670" y="927" width="300" height="26" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n246" value="T9" style="text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=11;fontColor=#555555;align=right;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacingLeft=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="560" y="928" width="52" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n249" value="Leitura ausente&lt;br&gt;(¬TIPO_A · ¬TIPO_B):&lt;br&gt;nenhuma transição dispara,&lt;br&gt;E1 aguarda leitura válida." style="text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=11;fontColor=#555555;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacingLeft=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="520" width="250" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n250" value="" style="shape=note;size=14;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;strokeWidth=1.5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=13;fontColor=#111111;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1270" y="110" width="460" height="210" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n251" value="E/S, tempos e seleção" style="text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;fontColor=#111111;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontStyle=1;spacingLeft=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1278" y="114" width="440" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n252" value="Entradas: S_PECA, TIPO_A, TIPO_B,&lt;br&gt;  FC_A_AV, FC_A_RET, FC_B_AV, FC_B_RET, RESET&lt;br&gt;Saídas: M_EST, DESVIO_A, DESVIO_B,&lt;br&gt;  LEITURA, ALARME&lt;br&gt;Tempo: 0,5 s de estabilização em E1&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Seleção exclusiva (T1, T2, T3):&lt;br&gt;A·¬B → ramo A   |   ¬A·B → ramo B&lt;br&gt;A·B → falha (inconsistência)&lt;br&gt;¬A·¬B → espera (nenhuma dispara)&lt;br&gt;→ nunca há duas receptividades verdadeiras." style="text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=11;fontColor=#111111;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacingLeft=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1278" y="138" width="440" height="178" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n253" value="" style="shape=note;size=14;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;strokeWidth=1.5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=13;fontColor=#111111;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1270" y="420" width="460" height="162" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n254" value="Sincronização e falha" style="text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;fontColor=#111111;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontStyle=1;spacingLeft=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1278" y="424" width="440" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n255" value="• O retorno do atuador (FC_x_RET) é&lt;br&gt;  confirmado antes de liberar a esteira:&lt;br&gt;  transportar com atuador projetado&lt;br&gt;  causaria colisão.&lt;br&gt;• T0 exige os dois atuadores recolhidos.&lt;br&gt;• E90: motor e atuadores em 0, alarme;&lt;br&gt;  sai só com RESET do operador e&lt;br&gt;  atuadores recolhidos." style="text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=11;fontColor=#111111;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacingLeft=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1278" y="448" width="440" height="130" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e166" value="" style="edgeStyle=none;html=1;rounded=0;strokeColor=#222222;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=11;fontColor=#111111;endArrow=none;endFill=1;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n163" target="n165"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e170" value="" style="edgeStyle=none;html=1;rounded=0;strokeColor=#222222;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=11;fontColor=#111111;endArrow=none;endFill=1;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;ex